# jest-image-snapshot local patch (saltos4, ujest)
#
# Upstream treats "write diff image" and "update baseline" as mutually
# exclusive in diffImageToSnapshot() (src/diff-snapshot.js): isFailure()
# is false whenever updateSnapshot is true, so `-u` runs silently
# overwrite a changed baseline without ever producing a __diff_output__
# image to review.
#
# This patch decouples the two decisions: a pixel mismatch during an
# `-u` run now both writes the diff PNG and updates the baseline, so
# `make ujest` (JEST_OPTIONS=-u) leaves a visual record of what changed.
#
# Targets jest-image-snapshot 6.5.2, installed globally (see NODE_PATH
# in the makefile). Applied automatically by the `ujest` makefile target
# via `patch`; safe to re-run (no-ops if already applied or if the
# installed version's context lines no longer match).
